## A note on commercialization

If you can figure out how to make money turning a spreadsheet into a khipu —
a product, a service, an art piece, whatever — go do it. You deserve the money.
The license already allows it. Just give credit.

— Charles Prescott

## KDB Recovery Record (pre-existing files)

The Harvard Khipu Database recovery files (`MANIFEST.csv`,
`recover_kdb_wayback.py`, `07_kdb_corpus_findings.md`,
`10_field_sheet_findings.md`, and the recovery README) retain their original
licensing: `recover_kdb_wayback.py` under the MIT License; all other recovery
files under CC BY 4.0. See `structural-spec/README.md` for the full rights
statement. By Edinson Sánchez and Claude.
